<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mirage recommendation.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mirage recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs analyst Steve Kent on Tuesday said he started coverage on Mirage Resorts Inc with a market outperform rating and a price target of between $28 and $30 a share.</p>
<p>-- Kent said his 1997 earnings estimate for the casino and hotel operator was $1.05 per share and his 1998 estimate was $1.20 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We feel this is one of the best companies, with a clear growth path,&quot; Kent said. &quot;It has a strong management team, and has had a solid financial and operating performance. Also, there balance sheet should allow them to fund growth.&quot;</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
